|\n      <a href=\"{{FACEBOOK_URL}}\" style=\"margin: 0 10px;\">Facebook</a> |\n      <a href=\"{{NEXTDOOR_URL}}\" style=\"margin: 0 10px;\">Nextdoor</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; color: #666;\">\n    <p>Questions? Contact us at {{BUSINESS_PHONE_NUMBER}} or {{BUSINESS_EMAIL}}</p>\n    <p>{{CLINIC_NAME}} - Caring for your pets like family 🐾</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
