      "parameters": {
        "content": "### {{CLINIC_NAME}} - Review Request System (PET WF7)\n\n**🎯 Purpose:** Automated review request system to boost online reputation and gather client feedback\n\n**🚀 Features:**\n• **Smart Timing:** Waits 24 hours after visit for optimal review timing\n• **Multi-Channel Approach:** Sends both SMS and email review requests\n• **Follow-up System:** Gentle reminder after 7 days if no review received\n• **Review Tracking:** Monitors review status and campaign completion\n• **Professional Messaging:** Personalized, branded communications\n\n**⚡ Workflow Process:**\n1. **Triggered by Visit Completion:** Activated by PET WF3 when visits end\n2. **Client Data Retrieval:** Gets client contact information from master sheet\n3. **24-Hour Wait:** Allows time for service experience before requesting review\n4. **Multi-Channel Outreach:** Sends personalized SMS and email review requests\n5. **Campaign Tracking:** Updates master hub with review request status\n6. **Follow-up Logic:** Waits 7 days, checks for received reviews\n7. **Gentle Reminder:** Sends follow-up SMS if no review received\n8. **Campaign Completion:** Marks review campaign as complete\n\n**📊 Integration Points:**\n• Master Appointments: {{MASTER_APPOINTMENTS_SHEET_ID}}\n• Reviews Tracking: {{REVIEWS_TRACKING_SHEET_ID}}\n• Google Reviews: {{GOOGLE_REVIEWS_URL}}\n• Alternative Platforms: Yelp, Facebook, Nextdoor\n\n**⚙️ Configuration:**\n• Clinic: {{CLINIC_NAME}}\n• Default Vet: {{DEFAULT_VETERINARIAN}}\n• Business Contact: {{BUSINESS_PHONE_NUMBER}} / {{BUSINESS_EMAIL}}\n• Brand Colors: {{CLINIC_COLOR}}\n• Timezone: {{TIMEZONE}}",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 900,
